-- 1g. Cross-scale key lifted from a NOT IN subquery (a null-aware anti
-- join): AggregateScan declines. Expected: 1 (only 3.30). Comparing raw
-- integers would also keep 2.20 (220 matches nothing in 1100, 2200, 110).
-- The NULL item is excluded by NOT IN either way. AggregateScan only
-- lifts NOT IN when aggregating over a join, hence the tags join in 1g-1i.
SELECT explain_redact_oid($$
SELECT count(*) FROM i6834_items i JOIN i6834_tags t ON i.id = t.item_id
WHERE i.amt NOT IN (SELECT amt FROM i6834_scale3) AND i.txt @@@ 'match'
$$);
WARNING:  Aggregate Scan (DataFusion) not used: join conditions compare NUMERIC columns with an unresolvable or mismatched representation (table: join)
                                                                       explain_redact_oid                                                                       
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Hash Join
         Hash Cond: (t.item_id = i.id)
         ->  Seq Scan on i6834_tags t
         ->  Hash
               ->  Custom Scan (ParadeDB Base Scan) on i6834_items i
                     Filter: (NOT (ANY (amt = (hashed SubPlan 1).col1)))
                     Table: i6834_items
                     Index: i6834_items_idx
                     Exec Method: NormalScanExecState
                     Scores: false
                     Tantivy Query: {"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"txt","query_string":"match","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
                     SubPlan 1
                       ->  Seq Scan on i6834_scale3
(14 rows)

