   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: i.id
         ->  Nested Loop Semi Join
               Join Filter: (i.amt = i6834_scale3.amt)
               ->  Custom Scan (ParadeDB Base Scan) on i6834_items i
                     Table: i6834_items
                     Index: i6834_items_idx
                     Exec Method: ColumnarExecState
                     Columnar: amt, id
                     Scores: false
                     Tantivy Query: {"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"txt","query_string":"match","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
               ->  Materialize
                     ->  Seq Scan on i6834_scale3
