                                                                                                       explain_redact_oid                                                                                                        
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Limit
   ->  Custom Scan (ParadeDB Join Scan)
         Relation Tree: i LEFTMARK i6834_scale2
         Join Cond: i.amt = i6834_scale2.amt
         Join Predicate: (mark = true OR col IS NULL)
         Limit: 10
